Plain and simple, I think it should, in general, not contain things that
the game itself doesn't tell you either (like weight of items, cost of
items, basic weapon damage, or lists as you'd find in the spoilers). A
lot of these are *meant* for you to figure out yourself, I think.

In short, don't duplicate the spoilers, but stick to the basic
information that the help function in the game already provides, adding
background information on and goal of the game.

A short how-to about the basic commands would also be appropriate,
sorted by subject, not alphabet.

At least point the reader to the help menu within the game, as well as
the / command to get information on both items and creatures (and even
on some backgrounds).

Finally, don't include anything the Oracle will tell you.

